<h1>AI-Powered Contract Review & Compliance</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Deals die in legal queues — not because the terms are wrong, but because the review takes too long, feedback is vague, and every contract gets the same level of scrutiny regardless of risk. This project shows how to cut contract turnaround from days to hours, free legal to focus on the deals that actually need human judgment, and eliminate the quarterly standoff between sales and legal.</p>

